{
  "spec_version": 1,
  "description": "Shared parsing/normalization corpus for HANDSHAKE.md invariants 1 and 2. Every client must turn `input` into `expect`, because the proxyServer string the browser is given has to be byte-identical in both commands and the credentials have to be decoded exactly once.",
